        "Yes, or the program stops when the condition is false",
        "Only when the condition compares two numbers"
      ],
      "answer": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "q11-v2",
      "text": "When an if has an else, how many of the two blocks run?",
      "options": [
        "Exactly one, picked by the condition",
        "Both, one after the other",
        "Neither, when the condition is false",
        "One or both, depending on the condition"
      ],
      "answer": 0
    },
    {
